# The codex CLI's runtime log, which once carried a ChatGPT account id into a
# commit. ROOT-ANCHORED and named: a blanket `*.log` also hid `evidence/**/*.log`,
# and `scripts/seal-evidence.sh` writes build.log, corpus-gate.log and
# tests-*.log into every seal — so the next seal would have been silently
# untracked while looking complete. Caught in review before it merged.
/error.log

